    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>Any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> that runs on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cells\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Energy Cells\">Energy Cells</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Packs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Packs\">Power Packs</a> can be modified to have two such power sources, doubling the duration the device will function (or the number of shots a Weapon can make before being recharged). It's possible to make this modification more than once, adding an additional <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cell</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> each time. The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cells\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Energy Cells\">Energy Cells</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Packs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Packs\">Power Packs</a> are typical for the device Upgraded, and each is replaced at the normal cost. </p>",
